Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hebat! Turun lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mu-Mustahil...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uangnya terus bertambah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cara realisasi keuntungannya\Nbagaimana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kalau pending order\Nuntuk menentukan harga, pakai ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau market order yang langsung\Nmenutup posisi, pakai ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}B-Bisa turun sejauh ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba kalau aku ikut menjual...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, enggak boleh!\NApa yang kupikirkan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak boleh begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah selesai!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uang ini sudah jadi milikku, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.83,0:00:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Iya...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:01:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah paham jurus jitu\Nbuat menang Forex!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.93,0:01:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau bertransaksi sesuai\Nsemua arahanmu,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku rasa pasti bisa menang terus!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menang terus?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.03,0:01:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal aku enggak dapat untung\Nsatu yen pun...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi benar-benar hebat\Nmengajari Forex,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}berkat dia aku menang terus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, sampai jumpa lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Mochiko juga semangat, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal tetangga,\Ntapi lama enggak ketemu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, Mebuki! Sudah lama, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini kamu libur kerja?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, begitulah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang aku mau ke game center.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mau ikut?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, aku ikut!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya ada cerita yang ingin\Nkuceritakan padamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.53,0:03:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa malah mulai main Forex?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.06,0:03:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal sudah kubilang jangan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau nurut arahan seniorku,\Nenggak akan bahaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ha? Siapa seniormu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Usianya seumuran,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi dia seniorku di bidang investasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.47,0:04:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu mulai main Forex juga,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.73,0:04:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}panggil aku senior juga, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gak sudi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dingin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagian, aku enggak akan main Forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.37,0:04:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hal seperti itu dirancang agar\Nsiapa pun pasti rugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu gim ampas!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal aku untung, loh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu cuan berapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekitar 150 ribu yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mudah banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Da-Dalam waktu singkat\Ndapat 150 ribu yen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko, jangan buang\Nsampah sembarangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar. Kamu cuma mengandalkan\Nleverage tinggi, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, enaknya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:04:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begini terus, nanti kamu\Ndijual ke pemandian plus-plus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Aku kan mandi setiap hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan itu maksudku, tolol!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama menang kamu enggak akan paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekali saja rugi di Forex,\Nkamu pasti ingin membalasnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat nilai taruhan membesar\Ndan enggak bisa mundur lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.10,0:05:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu awal mula RTA kebangkrutan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku menemukan mata uang\Nyang berpotensi menang!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namanya Pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah Pound itu mata uang pembunuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.34,0:05:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergerakan harganya terlalu parah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leverage tinggi itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}seperti naik roller coaster\Ntanpa sabuk pengaman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kyaaa...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko... kamu tahu banyak, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak paham!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga enggak main Forex!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih sudah mengkhawatirkanku,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi tenang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya aku punya...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:06:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jurus jitu menang Forex!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya kelihatan berat, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi, coba lihat ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makan malam bareng teman!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah lama enggak makan mewah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah, hari ini bukan soal Forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhir-akhir ini, dia menghubungi\Nhampir setiap hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma Mebuki yang menang terus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gampang banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal tebakanku selalu tepat,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi aku enggak dapat\Nuntung satu yen pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau aku minta\Nbiaya konsultasi saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:07:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minta uang itu sudah melanggar hukum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia enggak semudah itu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, sepertinya mau naik.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasang posisi beli 5 lot\Nbuat memantau, ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, bodohnya aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena enggak punya apa-apa\Nselain Forex,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}makanya aku selalu tergoda!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat SMA aku hanya belajar,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hidup tanpa pernah tahu rasanya bermain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Besok kuliah dan pasar libur,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mari pergi ke kota!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.59,0:07:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mencari hobi lain selain Forex!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saatnya menemukan diriku yang baru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semoga ada hobi yang cocok di sini...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.51,0:08:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, enggak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Agaknya bukan itu, lah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, kesempatan untuk tahu\Nhiburan orang dewasa...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}enggak ada salahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, tetap saja...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berhasil, berhasil!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Riichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Balapan bersama hewan hutan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, gagal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanpa paham apa-apa,\N5.000 yen milikku melayang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya sudahlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Main Forex sebentar saja\Njuga pasti balik.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebentar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.23,0:09:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, enggak, enggak!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kan sudah janji berhenti!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mungkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak bisa berhenti dari Forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau bagaimana lagi,\Naku kan selalu menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa lagi-lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.75,0:09:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ada uang di akun Forex milikku?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.48,0:09:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus mengingat lagi...\Nneraka saat itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.07,0:09:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang terbayang jelas justru...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}angka yang bersinar
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kebahagiaan yang luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengalaman seperti itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ingin kamu rasakan lagi, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dipikir-pikir,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}krisis besar itu enggak buruk, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena setelah melaluinya,\Nkemenangan besar menanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bu-Bukan...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Adrenalinmu terpacu kencang, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meluap-luap tanpa batas!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.02,0:10:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menahannya itu bikin stres, loh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.86,0:10:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari rasakan kenikmatan itu lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa pun, hentikan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seandainya aku enggak kenal Forex,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa yang kulakukan sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, kumis yang ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gambar apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Papan nama! Untuk di kamarku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Papan nama?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.41,0:11:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ih, gara-gara Ibu mengajak bicara,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku jadi salah gambar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, maaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, gambar kucingnya bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.57,0:11:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa depan mau jadi pelukis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku inginnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi guru TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi, sudah siap belum?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, seperti biasa...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.54,0:12:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tolong ramalannya, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini, Mebuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau kita\Nakhiri semuanya hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Kamu bilang sesuatu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak mau lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Firasatku... rasanya akan naik tajam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, enggak boleh ingin beli!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ramalan begini enggak bisa dipercaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi, yang mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kayaknya akan naik.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti aku ambil posisi beli!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Memutuskan semudah itu...\N- Sip, ayo naik!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- kapan saja bisa masuk neraka, tahu!\N- Sip, ayo naik!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Mendebarkan!\N- Yakin enggak mau beli?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat... mulai naik sesuai dugaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berhasil!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mungkin...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu memang hebat, Kak Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baru saja tembus 500 ribu yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luar biasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.99,0:13:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ritmenya begini,\Nbulan depan bisa tembus 1 juta yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asyik, asyik!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayang sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena kamu ragu-ragu terus,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.13,0:13:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}keuntunganmu jadi makin berkurang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kena rebut lagi, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.17,0:13:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menyedihkan ya, hasil membuang masa\Nmuda malah jadi begini...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki dalam hatinya pasti\Nberpikir begini, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih sudah bersusah payah\Nbelajar demi aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.45,0:14:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.45,0:14:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku belajar cuma demi diriku sendiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Merebut kembali 20 juta yen...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.63,0:14:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Demi itulah aku bertahan hidup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.19,0:14:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan pergi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.37,0:14:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Loh? Masih di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mari singkirkan dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:14:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan pergi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, naik dengan bagus, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana? Forex setelah sekian lama?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa bodoh karena pernah ragu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku boleh main Forex, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada akhirnya, Kurumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sama sekali tidak membayangkan\Ndirinya akan kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.30,0:16:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, dia tidak sanggup memikirkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebesar apa pun kerugian sementara,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}asalkan pada akhirnya menang,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hal itu akan terekam
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sebagai pengalaman sukses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baginya,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kemenangan dramatis yang cuma\Nberbekal keberuntungan saat itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menjadi kutukan yang takkan\Npernah hilang seumur hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.07,0:16:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kampusnya Mebuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kebetulan sekali dia memanggilku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan menjauhkannya\Ndari senior jahat itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.10,0:17:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Imutnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.09,0:17:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada anak kayak dia, ya? Kecil banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhir-akhir ini Kurumi makin\Nsering main Forex, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal tadinya ingin berhenti.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, rasanya masih bisa bertahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya lagi bagus juga, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin berkat Mebuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.66,0:17:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tebakan anak itu hampir selalu salah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, bisa dibilang dia jadi patokanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurutku ini masih akan naik!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti aku harus jual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.89,0:17:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu memanfaatkan Mebuki, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ja-Jangan asal bicara!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.09,0:17:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.13,0:17:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}justru aku kagum padamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memanfaatkan teman memang buruk,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.38,0:18:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kita ini pemain pasar, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.09,0:18:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Justru saling memanfaatkan\Ndemi keuntungan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah hubungan yang sehat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itu, aku senang kamu
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kembali ke pasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkinkah itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena kamu ingin memanfaatkanku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setengah benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jahat sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti aku juga akan\Nmemanfaatkanmu, loh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.51,0:18:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.82,0:18:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa-apaan mereka ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ngeri banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.31,0:18:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Senior!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, Mebuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm? Bareng temanmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:19:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku Yasuko. Salam kenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini aku mengajak Yasuko
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena kurasa pasti seru\Nkalau main Forex bersama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.99,0:19:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang aku enggak bakal main!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.44,0:19:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku saja bisa dapat lebih\Ndari 400 ribu yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko juga ingin menghasilkan uang, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan perlihatkan hal berbahaya begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanti aku jadi iri, tahu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko bukan mahasiswa sini, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.15,0:19:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu kuliah di mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dulu di akademi kejuruan,\Ntapi sekarang pekerja lepas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko itu seorang pengejar mimpi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.99,0:19:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ingin jadi desainer\Ndan buat merek "YASUKO".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya ingin buat itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.13,0:19:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, hebatnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seperti apa? Coba gambarkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.10,0:19:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengejar mimpi saja bilang hebat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naif sekali sampai membuat mual.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang terbukti berhasil yang hebat, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Imutnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.63,0:20:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lumayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata mereka berdua baik juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.19,0:20:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pernah mencoba membuat suvenir,\Ntapi enggak laku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menjadi kaya itu sulit, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan Forex, kamu bisa kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.33,0:20:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan pemikiran kenaikan\Nharga tanpa batas itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi nyatanya di antara kita,\Ncuma Yasuko yang belum untung.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya? Oke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga bakal main Forex!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.83,0:20:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, aku enggak akan berjudi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma pakai leverage rendah\Ndan mata uang dengan volatilitas kecil!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia berpengalaman, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku dapat ide bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau kita berlomba?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:20:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berlomba?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.55,0:20:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.10,0:21:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di antara kita,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}siapa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}...yang paling cepat...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}...bisa jadi kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.99,0:21:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namanya, Pertarungan Investasi Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada tahun itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.71,0:21:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pasar valuta asing yang tenang\Nsejak awal tahun
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akhirnya berakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.62,0:21:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasar super kacau...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang akan mengubah jalan hidup mereka\Nbaru saja dimulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.69,0:23:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa aku harus main Forex lagi, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.26,0:23:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal sudah janji enggak main lagi,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kenapa perasaanku\Nikut naik turun begini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sudah begini, mau enggak mau,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.87,0:23:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku harus mengeluarkan jurus andalanku!
